    "「黑白」会把每页转成灰度图片并保留可选取的文字；分辨率越高越清晰，文件也越大。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「黑白」会把每页转成灰度图片并保留可选取的文字；分辨率越高越清晰，文件也越大。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「黑白」會把每頁轉成灰階圖片並保留可選取的文字；解析度越高越清晰，檔案也越大。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\"Black & white\" turns each page into a grayscale image and keeps the text selectable; higher resolution is sharper but makes larger files."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
